 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The lamps were low in the upper room",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The bread was broken, the night came soon",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He told his friends that he had to go",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their faces fell and their hearts sank low",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not let your hearts be troubled",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trust in God, and trust in me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In my Father's house there are many rooms",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the way and the truth and the life",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I go ahead to make it ready there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A place for you, prepared with care",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will come back and take you to myself",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that where I am, you may be also",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not let your hearts be troubled",
