   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Thomas spoke for all the rest",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With a worried heart and an honest guess",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, we do not know where you are going",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can we know the way?",
